*************************************************************************
*                    PARAMETERS OF THE FIT
*************************************************************************
dipol_xy2_p                             <= type of function 
linur                                    <= fit_type (linur,dgelss) 
  40         <= Number of iterations in the fit (0-no fit) -  IterMax
  1.e-8  0.001       <= stab_best: Stability of the fit 
 0.52917721092       <= flag_borh: 1- bohr; 0- angstrom
 1.0d0             <= flag_hartre: 1- hartre, 0 - 1/cm 
1.0000       <= Parameter is out  if FACTOR_OUT*|PARAM(I)|<|StErr(I)|
1e-12         <= Parameter is back if (Delta StDev)/StDev >  FACTOR_back
2            <= Watson Robust fit on (1), off (0), or stand. from rob (2) 
